        "chinese": "鱼是出色的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 623.3199999999999,
        "end": 627.3599999999999,
        "english": "It sounds fantastic, but I'm allergic to seafood so...",
        "chinese": "英语：听起来很棒，但我对海鲜过敏。"
    },
    {
        "start": 627.3599999999999,
        "end": 630.56,
        "english": "Okay, well, let me think.",
        "chinese": "好的，明白了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 630.56,
        "end": 633.1199999999999,
        "english": "Oh, I know this great little place.",
        "chinese": "英语：哦，我认识这个好地方。"
    },
    {
        "start": 633.12,
        "end": 637.0,
        "english": "It's just a hole in the wall, but they do the most amazing sandwiches.",
        "chinese": "它只是一个洞，但他们做得真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 637.0,
        "end": 638.8,
        "english": "You could give them a try.",
        "chinese": "你可以说试一试。"
    },
    {
        "start": 638.8,
        "end": 642.72,
        "english": "Ella, you took me there last time I visited and I got food poisoning.",
        "chinese": "英语：Ella，你上次去我这里时吃了什么？"
    },
    {
        "start": 642.72,
        "end": 643.72,
        "english": "Remember?",
        "chinese": "英语：记住？"
    },
    {
        "start": 648.4,
        "end": 654.2,
        "english": "Okay, great dialogue and Erica, I know that you have some food poisoning stories for us.",
        "chinese": "好的，很好对话，艾瑞卡，我知道你有我们餐厅的一些食物中毒故事。"
    },
    {
        "start": 654.2,
        "end": 659.6,
        "english": "I don't know about stories, but I've definitely had food poisoning before.",
        "chinese": "我并不知道关于故事的事情，但我之前确实吃过食物中毒。"
    },
    {
        "start": 659.6,
        "end": 664.08,
        "english": "One of the worst times that I ever had food poisoning was when I was traveling in Morocco.",
        "chinese": "英语：有一次我最糟糕的旅行经历是在摩洛哥旅行时食物中毒。"
    },
    {
        "start": 664.08,
        "end": 665.08,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 665.08,
        "end": 672.52,
        "english": "I had some really amazing orange juice, really fresh squeeze that day in the morning.",
        "chinese": "我今天早上喝了一杯真的新鲜橙汁，味道超级好。"
    },
    {
        "start": 672.52,
        "end": 674.28,
        "english": "Then I got on a bus.",
        "chinese": "然后我上了公交车。"
    },
    {
        "start": 674.28,
        "end": 675.28,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 675.28,
        "end": 678.08,
        "english": "I think you can see where this is going.",
        "chinese": "我猜你能看清楚这个方向。"
    },
    {
        "start": 678.08,
        "end": 684.6800000000001,
        "english": "Yeah, so I was on the bus and then I started to feel really sick and I was just hoping",
        "chinese": "是的，所以我坐在公共汽车上，然后感觉非常不舒服，我正希望能尽快好起来。"
    },
    {
        "start": 684.6800000000001,
        "end": 688.5600000000001,
        "english": "and hoping and hoping that the bus ride would be over soon.",
        "chinese": "和希望这辆公共汽车很快就会结束了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 688.56,
        "end": 689.56,
        "english": "Yeah.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 689.56,
        "end": 690.56,
        "english": "Unfortunately, it wasn't...",
        "chinese": "不幸的是，它不是..."
    },
    {
        "start": 690.56,
        "end": 691.56,
        "english": "Oh, no.",
        "chinese": "英语：啊，不。"
    },
    {
        "start": 691.56,
        "end": 699.88,
        "english": "All I can say is that I was sick and all I can say is that I was pretty sick and really,",
        "chinese": "我只能说，我现在很不舒服，而且真的很不舒服。"
    },
    {
        "start": 699.88,
        "end": 700.88,
        "english": "really unhappy.",
        "chinese": "英语：真的非常不开心。"
    },
    {
        "start": 700.88,
        "end": 701.88,
        "english": "Yeah, I bet.",
        "chinese": "是的，我猜。"
    },
    {
        "start": 701.88,
        "end": 705.8399999999999,
        "english": "Well, that's very strange that you got sick from orange juice, huh?",
        "chinese": "英语：嗯，那可真是奇怪啊，你为什么从橙汁里得病了呢？"
    },
    {
        "start": 705.8399999999999,
        "end": 708.88,
        "english": "Well, yeah, maybe it was with some dirty water or something like that.",
        "chinese": "英语：嗯，对，或许它可能有某种脏水或者什么的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 708.88,
        "end": 709.88,
        "english": "I don't know.",
        "chinese": "我不会。"
    },
    {
        "start": 709.88,
        "end": 710.88,
        "english": "It was just...",
        "chinese": "刚刚..."
    },
    {
        "start": 710.88,
        "end": 711.88,
        "english": "It was a terrible situation.",
        "chinese": "这是一个非常糟糕的情况。"
    },
    {
        "start": 711.88,
        "end": 714.68,
        "english": "Yeah, it's always complicated when you're traveling to other countries.",
        "chinese": "是的，当你在国外旅行时总是会遇到很多复杂的情况。"
    },
    {
        "start": 714.68,
        "end": 719.0,
        "english": "It could be the water, it could be the way they prepare things.",
        "chinese": "英语：它可能是水，也可能是他们准备东西的方式。"
    },
    {
        "start": 719.0,
        "end": 720.0,
        "english": "Yeah.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 720.0,
        "end": 721.0,
        "english": "Food poisoning.",
        "chinese": "Food中毒。"
    },
    {
        "start": 721.0,
        "end": 724.3199999999999,
        "english": "Guys, I hope that you don't get food poisoning.",
        "chinese": "英文：朋友们，我希望大家不会得食物中毒。"
    },
    {
        "start": 724.3199999999999,
        "end": 727.4799999999999,
        "english": "And if you have any food poisoning stories, it would be great for you to share them.",
        "chinese": "如果你有食物中毒的故事，那一定很有趣。"
    },
    {
        "start": 727.4799999999999,
        "end": 731.04,
        "english": "Yes, at our website, www.englishpod.com.",
        "chinese": "是的，我们在我们的网站www.englishpod.com上。"
    },
